        "# GPT Model Assembly"
      ],
      "ordinal": 1,
      "source_sha256": "7737ac407e6ace503f5e375be18b4caeab2f7aa3c42fc9c4ee9367abc9c9e6d1",
      "target": "# 组装 GPT 模型\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0002",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly"
      ],
      "ordinal": 1,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0003",
      "kind": "blockquote",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly"
      ],
      "ordinal": 2,
      "source_sha256": "05f6d399e3c0fc95110ed199e5d09db16c789d090ef2563b56f45306495f5233",
      "target": "> 堆叠十二个块，再加上 token（词元，即模型处理文本的单位）嵌入（embedding）、一个可学习的位置嵌入、最后的 LayerNorm，以及一个共享权重的语言模型输出头，这就是整个拥有 124 million（百万）个参数的 GPT 模型。本课会将这些组件组装成一个可用的类，统计参数量以确认模型结构与 124M 参考模型一致，并通过多项式采样、温度参数和 top-k 生成文本。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0004",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly"
      ],
      "ordinal": 2,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly"
      ],
      "ordinal": 3,
      "source_sha256": "c2b7cc2a47ff325cadbf7805eaa771f0023abc79418fb692e4a9d10ca1fa4e48",
      "target": "**Type:** Build\n**Languages:** Python\n**Prerequisites:** 阶段 19，第 30 至 34 课\n**Time:** ~90 分钟\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0006",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly"
      ],
      "ordinal": 3,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0007",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## Learning Objectives"
      ],
      "ordinal": 4,
      "source_sha256": "584e52d24f2b17886a76212978741fa03ba6bc6aa292a0331b41402490b42267",
      "target": "## 学习目标\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0008",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## Learning Objectives"
      ],
      "ordinal": 4,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0009",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## Learning Objectives"
      ],
      "ordinal": 5,
      "source_sha256": "b07e4a0643849e45c62f2f1e90ebf9571587a0075075d2de9e02d04d5f00b225",
      "target": "- 将第 34 课的 Transformer 块组装成完整的 GPT 模型：token 嵌入、位置嵌入、N 个块、最后的 LayerNorm，以及语言模型输出头。\n- 复现拥有 124 million 个参数的配置：词表大小为 50257，上下文长度为 1024，嵌入维度为 768，十二个注意力头，十二层。\n- 将语言模型输出头的权重与 token 嵌入绑定，并解释为什么在这一规模下可节省 ~38 million 个参数。\n- 根据提示词（prompt）使用多项式采样、温度缩放和 top-k 截断生成文本，并利用滑动窗口控制上下文长度。\n- 以 124M 为目标，衡量参数量与前向传播的计算开销。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0010",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## Learning Objectives"
      ],
      "ordinal": 5,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 6,
      "source_sha256": "f88026ff32dd8f43def76262b9b1e99e1082ea528c571c9922238a9fa88f4fe5",
      "target": "## 要解决的问题\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0012",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 6,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 7,
      "source_sha256": "4eb46fd55ce580f2a50c6d5e53e46a5bb88fd0fdb5d4f83a3b94425a8609e04d",
      "target": "单个 Transformer 块无法独立发挥作用。你需要将 token ID 转换为向量，融入位置信息，使其通过堆叠的块，再投影回词表上的 logits（未经归一化的分数）。漏掉这四步中的任何一步，模型就可能无法执行前向传播、丢失准确的位置信息，或无法输出文本。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0014",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 7,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 8,
      "source_sha256": "a94ff8aada2d9010625740cdba8ee0c1ad691a2b4273a0f85655503df2764f43",
      "target": "模型的结构也很重要。参考模型 GPT-2 small 采用的正是上述配置，参数量为 124 million。这些数字并不神秘。词表大小 50257 乘以嵌入维度 768，就是 token 嵌入表。位置数 1024 乘以 768，就是位置嵌入表。十二个块，每块约有 7 million 个参数，总计 84 million。最后的输出头通过权重共享复用 token 嵌入表。把各部分加起来，就得到 124 million。如果构建的模型参数量与参考模型不符，就说明组件连接可能有误。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0016",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 8,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0017",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## The Concept"
      ],
      "ordinal": 9,
      "source_sha256": "c7b44801605d0b8c776d3915355cff883fdbf9e3ecb29219ac88ef4edd08ab1b",
      "target": "## 核心概念\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0018",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## The Concept"
      ],
      "ordinal": 9,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0019",
      "kind": "fence",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## The Concept"
      ],
      "ordinal": 10,
      "source_sha256": "83049ae608d79d8c3d227ab0458c03ffadec30878813f36699cde25434d76d77",
      "target": "```mermaid\nflowchart TB\n  T[Token ids<br/>shape B, T] --> E[Token embedding<br/>50257, 768]\n  T --> P[Position lookup<br/>0 to T-1]\n  P --> PE[Position embedding<br/>1024, 768]\n  E --> A[Add]\n  PE --> A\n  A --> D[Embedding dropout]\n  D --> B1[Block 1]\n  B1 --> B2[Block 2]\n  B2 --> Bk[...]\n  Bk --> B12[Block 12]\n  B12 --> L[Final LayerNorm]\n  L --> H[LM head<br/>tied to token embedding]\n  H --> O[Logits<br/>shape B, T, 50257]\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0020",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## The Concept"
      ],
      "ordinal": 10,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## The Concept"
      ],
      "ordinal": 11,
      "source_sha256": "707d2cdad7d5126a863746c99c1d65c330a29db74b4b3d2dccc2a599ce6aa846",
      "target": "token ID 转换成 token 向量，位置 ID 转换成位置向量。两者相加后送入堆叠的块。最后的 LayerNorm 是位于这些块之外、在所有现代变体中都保留下来的组件。语言模型输出头（LM head）复用 token 嵌入矩阵，这就是权重共享的含义。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0022",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## The Concept"
      ],
      "ordinal": 11,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0023",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Weight tying"
      ],
      "ordinal": 12,
      "source_sha256": "fcd81b2ab481b22d12bab5f2f373619cf6a26129bc2feb54f66ae665d95ca5fb",
      "target": "### 权重共享\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0024",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Weight tying"
      ],
      "ordinal": 12,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Weight tying"
      ],
      "ordinal": 13,
      "source_sha256": "ee1ca9c525470a5deea88f7681dd90f4554837d10c47e0488a00e0d93dfece04",
      "target": "token 嵌入的形状为 `(vocab, d_model)`。语言模型输出头需要将 `d_model` 投影回 `vocab`。这两个映射互为转置。将两者绑定，就是让同一个参数张量真正被使用两次。当 vocab 为 50257、d_model 为 768 时，该矩阵包含 38 million 个参数。不共享权重，就要为它支付两份开销；共享权重，就只需一份开销。由于嵌入层和输出头会同步更新，梯度信号也会稍微更清晰。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0026",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Weight tying"
      ],
      "ordinal": 13,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0027",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Position embedding is learned, not sinusoidal"
      ],
      "ordinal": 14,
      "source_sha256": "dfe7e368d18c2f666bab30d39a79cc9c9b8701d35accd9afa275760cbc4165d9",
      "target": "### 位置嵌入通过学习获得，而非使用正弦函数\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0028",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Position embedding is learned, not sinusoidal"
      ],
      "ordinal": 14,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Position embedding is learned, not sinusoidal"
      ],
      "ordinal": 15,
      "source_sha256": "84fcaed3391709329c9d7649832a54e069d639af7ed00c1206f512fd1fd09f0c",
      "target": "GPT-2 采用可学习的位置嵌入。位置表是形状为 `(1024, 768)` 的单个参数张量。每次前向传播时，模型都会查询位置 0 到 T-1 的嵌入，并将查询结果加到 token 嵌入上。这是最简单的位置编码方案（其他方案包括 RoPE、ALiBi 和 T5 相对位置偏置），也是 124M 参考模型所使用的方案。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0030",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Position embedding is learned, not sinusoidal"
      ],
      "ordinal": 15,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0031",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Generation: temperature, top-k, multinomial"
      ],
      "ordinal": 16,
      "source_sha256": "2d16c7dce669a30852863b6ffda0160efc33df257051ed59b278d81c35a3db37",
      "target": "### 生成：温度、top-k 与多项式采样\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0032",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Generation: temperature, top-k, multinomial"
      ],
      "ordinal": 16,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Generation: temperature, top-k, multinomial"
      ],
      "ordinal": 17,
      "source_sha256": "56560f872ebfc909376140433d586f45f9b64b2d7f4b097b4642fd8628176ddc",
      "target": "生成采用自回归方式。每一步，模型都会返回每个位置上覆盖整个词表的 logits。只取最后一个位置的 logits，除以温度；也可以选择将前 k 大之外的所有 logits 都屏蔽为负无穷，再用 softmax 得到概率，最后从所得分布中采样一个 token。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0034",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Generation: temperature, top-k, multinomial"
      ],
      "ordinal": 17,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0035",
      "kind": "fence",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Generation: temperature, top-k, multinomial"
      ],
      "ordinal": 18,
      "source_sha256": "8601560ff6c7ece6767efe65c0a43df65ac359c5c6e7d1c9597c5037a3bb2476",
      "target": "```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n  P[Prompt tokens] --> M[Model forward]\n  M --> Last[Take last position logits]\n  Last --> T[Divide by temperature]\n  T --> K[Mask to top k]\n  K --> S[Softmax]\n  S --> MN[Multinomial sample]\n  MN --> A[Append to context]\n  A --> Slide[Slide context if > ctx_len]\n  Slide --> M\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0036",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Generation: temperature, top-k, multinomial"
      ],
      "ordinal": 18,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Generation: temperature, top-k, multinomial"
      ],
      "ordinal": 19,
      "source_sha256": "418aacbe714da4922d8a0bda17484042d30d087055eb41de3e9759338b6092bf",
      "target": "三个调节项，对应三种不同的行为。温度接近零时，会趋于贪心选择。温度为一时，保持模型原本的分布。Top-k 为一时，就是贪心选择。Top-k 为四十时，会滤除长尾。这些参数的组合很重要；下一课讲训练时，会把生成结果作为定性评估信号。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0038",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Generation: temperature, top-k, multinomial"
      ],
      "ordinal": 19,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0039",
