    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## Build It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 22,
      "source_sha256": "af5f20217861f8d9f142cd8513cfb0d9c533101884490d56c616d03dfa1f4fa9",
      "target": "`code/main.py` 实现了以下内容：\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0044",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## Build It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 22,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0045",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## Build It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 23,
      "source_sha256": "819eeca9f56fd4682c35417168fa439bd55dc9854bfcc141a309eefb03841c18",
      "target": "- `class GPTConfig` 数据类，用于保存 124M 的默认配置：`vocab_size=50257`、`context_length=1024`、`d_model=768`、`num_heads=12`、`num_layers=12`、`mlp_expansion=4`、`dropout=0.1`、`use_bias=True`、`weight_tying=True`。\n- `class GPTModel` 模型类，包含 token 嵌入、位置嵌入、嵌入层 dropout、十二个 `TransformerBlock`、最后的 LayerNorm，以及一个 `lm_head`；相应标志开启时，该输出头与 token 嵌入共享权重。\n- 一个 `count_parameters` 辅助函数，返回去重后的参数量，因此统计结果会正确计入权重共享的影响。\n- 一个 `generate` 函数，实现温度、top-k、多项式采样和滑动窗口上下文。\n- 一个演示程序，构建模型，打印参数量并与 124M 参考值并列展示，再根据固定提示词生成一小段序列，展示完整流程。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0046",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## Build It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 23,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## Build It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 24,
      "source_sha256": "936bc51db6511ea885c12022f0e1271632a7d165e0848edeaf255b3a5786e28d",
      "target": "运行：\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0048",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## Build It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 24,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0049",
      "kind": "fence",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## Build It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 25,
      "source_sha256": "6fe59b750977b521bbd15c9652ae3cc166374f901cb95f15c82098d0bba5368b",
      "target": "```bash\npython3 code/main.py\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0050",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## Build It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 25,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## Build It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 26,
      "source_sha256": "e5a5c16a9f9b8e7502c7860b7a25181e8f58345e8ab12676b7126cbb1df28d25",
      "target": "输出包括：与 124M 参考值并列显示的参数量、从随机提示词生成的 token ID，以及开启权重共享时语言模型输出头和 token 嵌入是否共用存储空间的确认结果。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0052",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## Build It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 26,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## Build It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 27,
      "source_sha256": "db40bc6d305983f6be47b4a7f4ba2381a73def209d9023561bb70a1d4bc00aa7",
      "target": "为了让演示快速运行，脚本还会用一个微型配置（`d_model=64`、`num_layers=2`）跑通完整流程，并直接打印生成的 token 序列。对于 124M 配置，脚本会构建模型，但只统计参数量并执行一次前向传播。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0054",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## Build It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 27,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0055",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## Stack"
      ],
      "ordinal": 28,
      "source_sha256": "d95c9f81ef0a32e15c3b471b4534628b1a56bbc26f5327ede041c08413c287e7",
      "target": "## 技术栈\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0056",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## Stack"
      ],
      "ordinal": 28,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0057",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## Stack"
      ],
      "ordinal": 29,
      "source_sha256": "590137b2add1d4564b0ca1944fabe8407833ac0e13e19e864a685e7e1db9b42f",
      "target": "- 使用 `torch` 进行张量计算、自动微分和模块组装。\n- `code/main.py` 在本地重新实现了第 34 课的块结构。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0058",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## Stack"
      ],
      "ordinal": 29,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0059",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## Production patterns in the wild"
      ],
      "ordinal": 30,
      "source_sha256": "fd0da009b5da595f36df91c69cb041b5e435a2310d1a8e10afaf5cb3e1f4fb7e",
      "target": "## 生产环境中的实践模式\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0060",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## Production patterns in the wild"
      ],
      "ordinal": 30,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## Production patterns in the wild"
      ],
      "ordinal": 31,
      "source_sha256": "1129caf097b9b9bc0a42c226efc9221b300a97f2072131f652c91a13f2fa9ca5",
      "target": "下面三种做法，决定了模型只是能运行，还是能真正交付使用。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0062",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## Production patterns in the wild"
      ],
      "ordinal": 31,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## Production patterns in the wild"
      ],
      "ordinal": 32,
      "source_sha256": "bc507bb6a46c69233e3b220ad39b965bc28d9d64edb1a947734c3b480daf6fd6",
      "target": "**将残差投影初始化为较小的值。** 注意力的输出投影和 MLP 的第二个线性层都会直接参与残差相加。如果用与其他线性层相同的标准差初始化它们，残差流的幅值就会随深度增长，使最后的 LayerNorm 进入数值偏大的工作区间。将这两个投影的标准差乘以 `1 / sqrt(2 * num_layers)`，残差流就能在经过十二层时始终保持在合理范围内。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0064",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## Production patterns in the wild"
      ],
      "ordinal": 32,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## Production patterns in the wild"
      ],
      "ordinal": 33,
      "source_sha256": "19c85ea4d7389cf30d1c21795799cf530997b65d87ceb29b06d63ab33040dcee",
      "target": "**缓存位置 ID 张量，不要重复计算。** `torch.arange(T)` 在每次前向传播时都会分配新的内存。在 `__init__` 中按最大上下文长度分配一次，每次调用时切出前 T 项，即可省去反复调用内存分配器的开销。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0066",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## Production patterns in the wild"
      ],
      "ordinal": 33,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## Production patterns in the wild"
      ],
      "ordinal": 34,
      "source_sha256": "fe1ac25acc0042d71492652586eb49fd60a8a0bd75023a7bb7a7cdd2e8693cc9",
      "target": "**在参数层面共享权重，而不是仅仅复制数值。** 设置 `lm_head.weight = token_embedding.weight` 会共享张量；复制则不会。优化器应只更新一个参数，自动微分图也应只进行一次梯度累积。如果只是复制，输出头就会逐渐偏离嵌入层，权重共享也就失去了意义。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0068",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## Production patterns in the wild"
      ],
      "ordinal": 34,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0069",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## Use It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 35,
      "source_sha256": "5ea8444f1e52d79d0fa5a9889d9e68b6f9378788af91764ac90a2934dcc50b2b",
      "target": "## 实际使用\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0070",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## Use It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 35,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0071",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## Use It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 36,
      "source_sha256": "7eb7a0ea64176574c7400567f99c0b8de722fa1e87ce16551c1bfd4adfe124bb",
      "target": "- 本课模型类的结构，与下一课要训练的模型相同。\n- 将可学习的位置嵌入替换为 RoPE，就能得到 LLaMA 系列模型，无需改动块或输出头。\n- 将 GELU 替换为 SiLU、将 LayerNorm 替换为 RMSNorm，就能完成 LLaMA 系列的其余改动。\n- 生成函数适用于任何来源的 logits，不仅限于本课模型。你可以在第 37 课中从预训练 GPT-2 文件获取 logits，并复用同一个生成循环。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0072",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## Use It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 36,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0073",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## Exercises"
      ],
      "ordinal": 37,
      "source_sha256": "a4807fe836e0096bcaf158b29f934e8fe31d4f4827549967dfe8f4f2fb831a64",
      "target": "## 练习\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0074",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## Exercises"
      ],
      "ordinal": 37,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0075",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## Exercises"
      ],
      "ordinal": 38,
      "source_sha256": "eeb6c6c192068dc0b0b9d11c7f06bbc5eefe22a795987c42fcccb2f32cdcdf2a",
      "target": "1. 解除语言模型输出头与 token 嵌入之间的权重共享，重新统计参数量。验证增量为 50257 乘以 768 = 38 million。\n2. 将可学习的位置嵌入替换为在构造时计算的正弦位置表。确认模型仍能执行前向传播，且参数量减少 786,432。\n3. 为生成函数添加 `greedy=True` 标志，跳过采样，直接选择 argmax。确认多次运行生成的序列一致。\n4. 添加一个 `repetition_penalty` 调节项，在 softmax 之前，将提示词或已生成历史中出现过的任意 token 的 logit 除以一个常数。用固定提示词展示：该值大于一时，输出中的重复次数会减少。\n5. 在 `top_k` 之外添加 `top_p`（核采样）选项。用两行代码检查保留 token 的概率之和是否超过 `top_p`。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0076",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## Exercises"
      ],
      "ordinal": 38,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0077",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## Key Terms"
      ],
      "ordinal": 39,
      "source_sha256": "c9a48ecf34a7d8550efdf7b469e84d28521007a46a3bc08fc1e840691c760c42",
      "target": "## 关键术语\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0078",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## Key Terms"
      ],
      "ordinal": 39,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0079",
      "kind": "table",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## Key Terms"
      ],
      "ordinal": 40,
      "source_sha256": "20bb600a236cf03b7cca44f31e7da6bdec9f2331262022c7830a609e01d14470",
      "target": "| 术语 | 常见说法 | 实际含义 |\n|------|-----------------|------------------------|\n| 权重共享 | “绑定嵌入” | 语言模型输出头与 token 嵌入共享同一个参数张量；节省 vocab 乘以 d_model 个参数，并与 GPT-2 参考模型保持一致 |\n| 位置嵌入 | “学习得到的位置表示” | 一个形状为 (context length, d_model) 的独立表，与 token 向量相加；通过端到端训练学习得到 |\n| 滑动窗口上下文 | “上下文上限” | 当提示词与已生成 token 的总长度超过上下文长度时，丢弃最早的 token，使当前窗口不超出限制 |\n| Top-k 采样 | “K 截断” | 保留数值最大的 K 个 logits，将其余值屏蔽为负无穷，再对保留部分执行 softmax |\n| 温度 | “采样温度” | 在 softmax 之前将 logits 除以 T；T 小于 1 时分布变尖锐，T 等于 1 时保持原本的分布，T 大于 1 时分布变平坦 |\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-35:b0080",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPT Model Assembly",
        "## Key Terms"
      ],
      "ordinal": 40,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
